{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "official-api-v1",
    "name": "Contact Form API - Frontend Developer Guide",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "# Contact Form Backend API\n\n## Overview\nThis API provides endpoints for managing contact forms, waitlists, and admin operations.\n\n## Base URL\n- **Local Development**: http://localhost:8081\n- **Production**: [Your Render URL]\n\n## Authentication\nAdmin endpoints require JWT token authentication. Use the login endpoint first to get a token.\n\n## Common Response Format\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Success message\",\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-31T00:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n- **400**: Bad Request (validation errors)\n- **401**: Unauthorized (missing/invalid token)\n- **404**: Not Found\n- **500**: Internal Server Error"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-set auth token for admin endpoints",
          "if (pm.request.url.toString().includes('/admin/') && !pm.request.url.toString().includes('/login')) {",
          "    const token = pm.environment.get('authToken') || pm.globals.get('authToken');",
          "    if (token) {",
          "        pm.request.headers.add({",
          "            key: 'Authorization',",
          "            value: 'Bearer ' + token",
          "        });",
          "    }",
          "}"
        ],
        "type": "text/javascript"
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Save token to environment/global variable",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (response.token) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('authToken', response.token);",
                  "        pm.globals.set('authToken', response.token);",
                  "        console.log('✅ Token saved successfully');",
                  "    }",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('❌ Login failed');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@msc.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin2025@\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "login"]
            },
